        "original_id": "83737266-2755-51fe-95e7-27809bedfdb7",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Joe Smith Jr., Andrzej Fonfara, Bernard Hopkins\n- Roles: professional boxers, world champion\n- Topics: boxing victories, knockout, stoppage, retirement\n\nFacts:\n- Andrzej Fonfara was born on 4 November 1987 and is a Polish professional boxer.\n- Andrzej Fonfara held the IBO light heavyweight title from 2012 to 2013.\n- Joe Smith Jr. rose to prominence in 2016 by scoring an upset knockout victory over Andrzej Fonfara.\n- Joe Smith Jr. later became the first boxer to stop former world champion Bernard Hopkins.\n- Bernard Hopkins retired after his fight with Joe Smith Jr.",
